# Combat Manoeuvre 2 — the doorway.
# No pits, no spikes. A sealed chamber with one tile of exit.
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot
#   any other letter = an enemy declared by a 'spawn' line below

id: cb-02-rank-and-file
number: 502
name: Rank and File
description: Four Husks and a Lobber share one doorway. Shove the unit in the door back into the queue and two of them die at once.

spawn h = Husk
spawn l = Lobber

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

board:
